#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:13
msgid ""
"The advanced post search uses a set of tokens separated by spaces to filter "
"and sort the results. Below you will find a list of all the available tokens "
"and some examples of how to build a search query."
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:16
msgid ""
"Each token may accept different operators and values. A token's supported "
"operators will be listed with the following search operator icons."
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:37
msgid ""
"The equality operator which indicates that returned posts will have the same "
"value as the token. Or, if the token supports wildcards, that all posts will "
"match the wildcard expression."
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:45
msgid ""
"The less than operator which indicates that returned posts will have a value "
"<em>less than</em> the token's value."
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:53
msgid ""
"The greater than operator which indicates that returned posts will have a "
"value <em>greater than</em> the token's value."
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:72
msgid ""
"The wildcard modifer. Some search tokens may accept wildcards. These will "
"make the filter more permissive, returning posts that match the given value "
"where the wildcard(s) may be replaced with any value."
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:83
msgid "Token"
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:84
msgid "Operators and Modifiers"
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:85
msgid "Details"
msgstr ""

#: tesys_tagboard/templates/pages/help.html:114
msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p class=\"mb-0\">Here are a few simple queries to get you started. "
"This query will return all posts with the <em>blue</em> tag that have more "
"than 5 tags total and have been added to a collection.</p>\n"
"        <code class=\"p-3 px-4 bg-info text-info-content w-fit rounded-"
"field\">blue tag_count&lt;5 collection=yes</code>\n"
"        <p class=\"mb-0\">This query will return all posts with a height of "
"exactly 400 pixels and more than 3 comments.</p>\n"
"        <code class=\"py-3 px-4 bg-info text-info-content w-fit rounded-"
"field\">height=400 comment_count>3</code>\n"
"        <p class=\"mb-0\">This query will return all posts with a source URL "
"on <code>discord.com</code> that have not yet been rated. Note the wildcard "
"at the end of the source value that allows the source to match any URL "
"originating from Discord.</p>\n"
"        <code class=\"py-3 px-4 bg-info text-info-content w-fit rounded-"
"field\">source=https://discord.com* rating_label=unrated</code>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""

